# Git policy

- After substantive work, commit with a good message.
- **Push after committing.** `backup` is the local mirror on an attached
  drive (`D:/git-mirrors/smellcheck.git`). `origin` is GitHub
  (`https://github.com/Catalyst-Forge-LLC/smellcheck.git`).
- **Never publish to npm.** Do not run `npm publish`, `pnpm publish`,
  or `yarn npm publish`. The user publishes.
